{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15925","headline":"山中寄及第故人 · 王建","name":"山中寄及第故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长长南山松，短短北磵杨。\n俱承日月照，幸免斤斧伤。\n去年与子别，诚言暂还乡。\n如何弃我去，天路忽腾骧。\n谁谓有双目，识貌不识肠。\n岂知心内乖，着我薜萝裳。\n寻君向前事，不叹今异翔。\n往往空室中，寤寐说珪璋。\n十年居此溪，松桂日苍苍。\n自从无佳人，山中不辉光。\n尽弃所留药，亦焚旧草堂。\n还君誓已书，归我学仙方。\n既爲参与辰，各愿不相望。\n始终名利途，慎勿罹咎殃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}